{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/Billy0xFF/status/2104795363140096270","id":"2104795363140096270","text":"https://x.com/i/article/2104781994970558465","raw_text":{"text":"https://t.co/K5JEv9Z10W","display_text_range":[0,23],"facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[0,23],"original":"https://t.co/K5JEv9Z10W","replacement":"https://x.com/i/article/2104781994970558465","display":"x.com/i/article/2104…"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"Billy0xFF","url":"https://x.com/Billy0xFF","id":"1467025882141233155","followers":1495,"following":246,"likes":96,"media_count":8,"name":"0xBilly","description":"计算机博士@PKU1898，套利爱好者","raw_description":{"text":"计算机博士@PKU1898，套利爱好者","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1921952161568894976/NRkH7mPM_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sat Dec 04 07:01:52 +0000 2021","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":20,"retweets":22,"likes":160,"bookmarks":262,"quotes":9,"created_at":"Tue Sep 29 04:48:14 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790657294,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":29418,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":null,"replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"source":"Twitter Web App","article":{"created_at":"2026-09-29T04:48:14.000Z","modified_at":"2026-09-29T04:56:52.000Z","id":"2104781994970558465","title":"三星除息日——7.5%利润大容量无风险规则套利复盘 ","preview_text":"9 月 29 日三星除息。Binance 用一笔特殊资金费把分红补给永续多头，Hyperliquid 不补。然而，两所对除息信息产生不同原因的定价错误。我们在 BN 做多、HL 做空，持有约 12 小时，最终不加杠杆利润率","cover_media":{"id":"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHTW2c2JaAAAKAAIUW+xEZVUQAwAA","media_id":"2104789007553134592","media_info":{"__typename":"ApiImage","color_info":{"palette":[{"percentage":91.8,"rgb":{"blue":38,"green":19,"red":11}},{"percentage":2.28,"rgb":{"blue":146,"green":135,"red":130}},{"percentage":2.21,"rgb":{"blue":33,"green":51,"red":56}},{"percentage":1.98,"rgb":{"blue":24,"green":102,"red":126}},{"percentage":0.52,"rgb":{"blue":17,"green":145,"red":186}}]},"original_img_height":1200,"original_img_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTW2c2JaAAARCIU.jpg","original_img_width":3000},"media_key":"3_2104789007553134592"},"content":{"blocks":[{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dh4oi","text":"9 月 29 日三星除息。Binance 用一笔特殊资金费把分红补给永续多头，Hyperliquid 不补。然而，两所对除息信息产生不同原因的定价错误。我们在 BN 做多、HL 做空，持有约 12 小时，最终不加杠杆利润率 1.5%，两所10倍杠杆利润率7.5%。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"89hu3","text":"一、背景：三星1.7%大额特殊分红","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8kc5h","text":"三星平时每季度股息率 0.1% 出头，没人在意。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fub3l","text":"8 月，三星公告 Q3 派息总额约 30 万亿韩元，折合约 4,500–4,600 韩元/股，约占股价 1.67%。除息时点是固定的：北京时间 9 月 29 日早上 7 点，韩国 NXT 盘前开盘那一刻。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"co21m","text":"二、两家交易所的规则不一样","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"d26r3","text":"现货股东除息时，股价掉 1.7%，账户里多出 1.7% 的应收股息，两者抵消。永续合约没有股息，如果交易所什么都不做，多头就白亏这 1.7%。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":7,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"cqfkn","text":"Binance：TradFi 永续有专门的 Special 资金费。除息那一刻额外结算一次，费率 = −每股分红 / 价格，由空头付给多头。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":11,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"90jo9","text":"Hyperliquid：文档写明持仓者不获得分红。除息时价格跟着现货下跳，多头吃下跌幅。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"adq9f","text":"所以理论上：Binance 永续的合理价格 ≈ 现货；HL 永续的合理价格 ≈ 现货 − 分红。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"54f4i","text":"三、错价拆解：谁错了，错了多少","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3ken7","text":"要把错价拆开，需要一个两边共同的参照，也就是三星现货本身。我们取北京时间 9 月 28 日 19:00 前最后一刻：这时韩国 NXT 盘后还在交易、现货有实时价格，下一秒 HL 就要切到内部盘。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":0,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"agvj0","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3n41k","text":"131bp 的错价里，HL 占 72bp（约 55%），BN 占 59bp（约 45%）。两边都错了，HL 错得更多。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":1,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2b4de","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"484vv","text":"四、HL 为什么错：资金费算错了","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":14,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"84l24","text":"4.1 HL 的资金费怎么收","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e1r2i","text":" xyz的RWA永续每小时整点结算一次资金费，每 8 小时的费率是：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7ms1c","text":"F₈ = 0.5 × [P + clamp(0.01% − P, ±0.03%)]","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":20,"offset":14,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"70epa","text":"永续深度折价时，公式简化成：每小时多头收 −(P + 3bp)/16","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":13,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"fqh7e","text":"4.2 逐小时倒推合理折价","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":30,"offset":11,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"54rgv","text":"\"完全定价\"的意思是：无论在哪个时点买入 HL 多头、持有到除息，都既不赚也不亏。 每小时都要满足这个条件，所以折价不是恒定的，而是越接近除息越深。经过公式推导，还剩 n 次结算时，合理折价是：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"br906","text":"P(n) = −3 + (3 − d) × (16/17)ⁿ","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fnv2r","text":"其中，关键在于 n 该数几次。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":15,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"e28kn","text":"4.3 为什么盘后是\"内部盘\"","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e8t9","text":"xyz的参考价在传统市场开盘的时候来自外部成交。而北京时间 19:00 韩国 NXT 收盘后，到次日 07:00 盘前开盘，中间没有任何外部成交价。这 12 小时里，参考价改用 HL 自己盘口中间价的 30 分钟指数均线。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9gds4","text":"参考价追着合约自己的价格走，合约折价多少参考价就跟多少，假设价格变化是0，溢价 P 的数学期望是0，隔夜的资金费可以当成0。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ku4c","text":"所以19:00时，理论上−160bp的折价就应该完全price in，因为之后的资金费期望是0。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":2,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"990a6","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":9,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"35vct","text":"4.4 市场错在哪","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"343ke","text":"市场给的 −88bp，相当于以为切换前还有约 11 次结算，和\"把隔夜也当成收费时间\"的错误算法（−77bp）很接近。也就是说，市场默认 HL 会像普通 24 小时永续一样整晚收资金费，以为\"折价 88bp 加一晚资金费\"就能补回分红。实际上 19:00 之后是内部盘，一晚上只收到个位数 bp，这 88bp 的折价只补偿了分红的一半多。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":3,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3lc8l","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8433a","text":"五、Binance 为什么错：不知道、或者不信它会补","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c4edq","text":"Binance 的合理溢价约等于 0。它会补分红，除息那一刻多头不亏，所以 Binance 永续应该跟现货持平；当晚 Binance 的常规资金费也基本为 0。市场却给了 −59bp 的折价，相当于只相信 Binance 会补约 65%。原因有三个：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bc78i","text":"很多人不知道 Binance 会补。大家对永续的默认认知是\"没有分红\"。","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2nlpi","text":"知道的人也不确定补多少。三星公告只有总额，精确的具体每股金额 10 月底才定；","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"d045f","text":"大额特别分红没有先例。","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1vo22","text":"我们为什么一开始就认为 Binance 会补：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ftb27","text":"金额好估，不确定性小。 30 万亿 ÷ 流通股数 ≈ 4,570 韩元/股；就算按 28 万亿保守算，也有 1.5% 以上。\"每股金额没定\"并不妨碍 Binance 先按估算值补，最多事后补差。","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3pjns","text":"Binance 已经在为大额补偿做准备。 SAMSUNGUSDT 交易页挂着一条三星专属提示：\"分红补偿不受资金费上限约束，可能高于上限\"，同期其他韩股页面没有。如果只是补 370 韩元的常规季息，根本碰不到上限，没必要挂这条。","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5djon","text":"ETF 已经有\"按预估先补\"的先例。 Binance 规则写明，ETF 的分红本来就是按预估金额在除息时结算。三星\"只有总额、每股待定\"本质上是同一种情况，套用同一套做法就行。","type":"ordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":4,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8ns40","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2v97r","text":"9/28 20:45，Binance 发公告：按约 4,500 韩元/股补偿，最终金额确定后一周内补差。所有不确定性就此消掉。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1aqjo","text":"六、过程：价差是怎么被修正的","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":5,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6pn91","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":7,"offset":35,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"p421","text":"07:00:01，Binance 结算 Special 资金费，费率 −1.663%，反推约 4,508 韩元/股，和公告一致。之后两所价差回到接近 0。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5fhhn","text":"回头看，有两个建仓区间：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":15,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"49egu","text":"① 公告实锤前（20:45前）：价差只有 +0.2% 到 +0.3%，赌的是 Binance 会补、而且补得足额，这是这笔交易唯一的不确定性。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":22,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"be4ic","text":"② 实锤后（20:45 到 23:00 前）：Binance 公告已经给出补偿金额，最大的不确定性没了，但价差还停在 +0.5% 左右。这时候进场，风险更小，剩下的空间仍有约 1.1%，是整晚性价比最高的一段。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":2,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"ce70o","text":"平仓：07:00:01 补偿到账后随时可以平，价差迅速回到 0 附近。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3b2of","text":"七、结果：不加杠杆 1.5%，两所各 10 倍 7.5%","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2earl","text":"我们在价差 +0.3% 附近建仓，持有过除息，07:00 之后平仓：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bdpm2","text":"Special 资金费：+1.66%","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fndm4","text":"进出场价差变化：约 −0.14%","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"df0fm","text":"两边常规资金费合计：约 −0.01%","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":33,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"f2qcc","text":"合计约 +1.51%（名义本金，未扣手续费），持仓约 12 小时。","type":"unstyled"}],"entityMap":[{"key":"4","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"fc84dfb9-3196-4649-a372-0f519088e2e0","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"8","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2104793107946680320"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"5","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"a5fe6f88-e192-455b-a031-9ad1be707316","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"10","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2104793175902871552"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"1","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"b08544d2-9e2b-4eaa-8f75-a145a047ae70","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"4","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2104792857513201664"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"0","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"ca618f79-36be-4b72-9d41-514edfc390f9","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"2","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2104790636234944512"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"2","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"a5d012b3-d417-4d0a-a57b-3d4bad4573ca","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"6","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2104792976807628800"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"3","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"aec44d81-6d0d-4519-ae1f-2375